  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia EnergyWater Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the trust fund is to support the implementation of the Central Asia Energy-Water Development Program. The program aims to build energy and water security through regional cooperation. It aims to encourage energy development and trade, improve water productivity and management of energy-water linkages. Its outcomes are targeted to build analytical capacity and strengthen institutions to support transboundary dialogue, and exploration/preparation of key regional investments. The program is aimed at enabling Central Asia countries to take advantage of their resource base, maximize the benefits of energy and water management at the regional scale, while respecting national priorities and aspirations. The results of the program aim to contribute to regional stability.</narrative>
  </description>
